From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sam Feder <noreply@splitmind.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:02:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp-oauth): pass non-object metadata bodies through
 unchanged

#140: withoutPrivateKeyJwt threw when the library's AS metadata body was
null, an array or a primitive. It now returns the original response for
those. Tests also fix the changed-setting warning count for the read-only
startup warnings.

